    "text": "The 2026 Pokémon World Championships, held from 28 to 30 August 2026 in San Francisco, the first split across two venues: the Moscone Center for the main event and the Chase Center for Championship Sunday. Competitors got Paradise Resort with new art by Naoki Saito, revealed in June 2026 with their welcome kits; staff got a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing.",
